":\"ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(n0,2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),9:procUpper)\",\"kind\":\"def\"},{\"declaration_name_key\":\"ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(nn(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(n0,8:_private),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),0),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),13:givenOverlaps)\",\"kind\":\"def\"},{\"declaration_name_key\":\"ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(nn(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(n0,8:_private),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),0),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),14:forced_overlap)\",\"kind\":\"theorem\"},{\"declaration_name_key\":\"ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(nn(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(n0,8:_private),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),0),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),14:instance_lower)\",\"kind\":\"theorem\"},{\"declaration_name_key\":\"ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(nn(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(n0,8:_private),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),0),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),15:lower_half_half)\",\"kind\":\"theorem\"},{\"declaration_name_key\":\"ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(nn(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(n0,8:_private),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),0),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),15:lower_half_zero)\",\"kind\":\"theorem\"},{\"declaration_name_key\":\"ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(nn(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(n0,8:_private),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),0),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),15:span_saturation)\",\"kind\":\"theorem\"},{\"declaration_name_key\":\"ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(nn(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(n0,8:_private),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),0),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),16:instance_infimum)\",\"kind\":\"theorem\"},{\"declaration_name_key\":\"ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(nn(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(n0,8:_private),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),0),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),16:witness_realizes)\",\"kind\":\"theorem\"},{\"declaration_name_key\":\"ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(nn(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(n0,8:_private),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),0),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),17:feasible_nonempty)\",\"kind\":\"theorem\"},{\"declaration_name_key\":\"ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(nn(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(n0,8:_private),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),0),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),18:feasible_singleton)\",\"kind\":\"theorem\"},{\"declaration_name_key\":\"ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(nn(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(ns(n0,8:_private),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),0),2:D5),2:S3),7:Quantum),9:PureState),36:OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation),7:witness)\",\"kind\":\"def\"}]}"},{"sha":"d2ee4861f83ca616b3cd0d8511bbb6724c1fead1","filename":"Library/Observer/galvaobrod2020overlaps.md","status":"added","additions":29,"deletions":0,"changes":29,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Library%2FObserver%2Fgalvaobrod2020overlaps.md","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Library%2FObserver%2Fgalvaobrod2020overlaps.md","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Library%2FObserver%2Fgalvaobrod2020overlaps.md?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,29 @@\n+---\n+bibkey: galvaobrod2020overlaps\n+authors: Ernesto F. Galvão; Daniel J. Brod\n+year: 2020\n+title: \"Quantum and classical bounds for two-state overlaps\"\n+doi: 10.1103/PhysRevA.101.062110\n+url: https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.11039v3\n+claim: \"For three pure states with known overlaps r_AB and r_AC, the unknown overlap r_BC lies between explicit tight bounds r_- (or 0) and r_+; for a connected graph of known overlaps the paper propagates these three-state intervals by intersecting over common neighbours, and leaves open whether this procedure is optimal.\"\n+strata_touched:\n+  - D5/S3/Quantum/PureState/OverlapIntervalPropagationRefutation\n+license: citation-only\n+triage: anchor\n+---\n+\n+# Galvão and Brod, Quantum and classical bounds for two-state overlaps\n+\n+E. F. Galvão and D. J. Brod, Phys. Rev. A 101, 062110 (2020); arXiv:1902.11039v3. Quotations are from the v3 TeX source.\n+\n+For pure states the overlap is $r_{ij}=|\\langle i|j\\rangle|^2$. For the chain $B-A-C$ with known $r_{AB},r_{AC}$, put $r_\\pm=\\bigl(\\sqrt{r_{AB}r_{AC}}\\pm\\sqrt{(1-r_{AB})(1-r_{AC})}\\bigr)^2$. Then $r_{BC}\\le r_+$, and $r_{BC}\\ge r_-$ if $r_{AB}+r_{AC}>1$, otherwise $r_{BC}\\ge0$; the bounds hold for pure states of arbitrary dimension and are attained by suitable triples. For a connected graph of known overlaps, the procedure cycles $A$ over all common neighbours of $B,C$, intersects the inferred ranges for $r_{BC}$, adds the edge and repeats until the graph is complete. Section II.B continues:\n+\n+> We leave it as an open question whether this procedure is optimal, but emphasize that even the initial iteration that produces a complete graph already provides bounds for every pair of vertices, which may be useful even if not tight.\n+\n+## Verified locator\n+\n+Source: https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.11039v3\n+- DOI: https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevA.101.062110 (Physical Review A 101(6), article 062110; title, authors, journal, volume, issue and article number from Crossref).\n+- URL: https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.11039v3. The e-print member `overlap_pra_v3.tex` has 674 lines and md5 `52c4a57f4ae9ae3536a2134c036dc28d`. Locations:\n+  - overlaps and $r_\\pm$, l. 96–119; the three-state bounds, l. 121–131;\n+  - the propagation procedure, l. 150–156; the open question, l. 165."},{"sha":"0849857c78ca1fa00d6531b956dc093bc6e011d4","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/0ad0e07c6e51125bf5d60f837f173ddfd34f2bdcd4307e89567fbc5200cf42f7","status":"added","additions":6,"deletions":0,"changes":6,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F0ad0e07c6e51125bf5d60f837f173ddfd34f2bdcd4307e89567fbc5200cf42f7","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F0ad0e07c6e51125bf5d60f837f173ddfd34f2bdcd4307e89567fbc5200cf42f7","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F0ad0e07c6e51125bf5d60f837f173ddfd34f2bdcd4307e89567fbc5200cf42f7?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@\n+**定理 486.4（无条件双侧无界性）。** 设 (485.1) 成立，则 $\\liminf_{x\\to\\infty}\\mathcal T(x)=-\\infty$。再设 (486.1)，则 $\\limsup_{x\\to\\infty}\\mathcal T(x)=+\\infty$。等价地，对每个实数 $\\kappa$ 与每个有限 $X$，存在 $x\\ge X$ 使 $T_\\psi(x,x^{4/5})<-\\kappa x^{11/10}$；在 (486.1) 下也存在 $x\\ge X$ 使 $T_\\psi(x,x^{4/5})>\\kappa x^{11/10}$。\n+\n+证明。RH 成立时由定理 486.3 得出；RH 不成立时由定理 485.2 与 485.3 得出，此时不需要 (486.1)。等价形式由 (481.1) 的归一化给出。证毕。\n+\n+推论 485.4 中对每个 $\\kappa<1/2$ 成立的结论，由此推广到每个实数 $\\kappa$。\n+"},{"sha":"99e809996c151579ba9da8ebeafb500ac8507574","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/129abb2217efd27c267e5933128a10f779faa4c7b1312bd55ebe68984ea26b29","status":"added","additions":5,"deletions":0,"changes":5,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F129abb2217efd27c267e5933128a10f779faa4c7b1312bd55ebe68984ea26b29","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F129abb2217efd27c267e5933128a10f779faa4c7b1312bd55ebe68984ea26b29","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F129abb2217efd27c267e5933128a10f779faa4c7b1312bd55ebe68984ea26b29?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@\n+**范围与文献归属。** 以下各项是经典输入：\n+- (485.1)、(486.1) 与 Landau–Widder 定理；\n+- $\\zeta(1/2)\\ne0$；\n+- 正核配合 Landau 正性来约束边界留数，属于 Ingham 振荡方法。\n+"},{"sha":"a98bfe64d41d6c316f01783cbfeec2e034122a05","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/1ff04e23a08d482b4b22f854e2b24dc21512151726ba0e798b32efc094746cf0","status":"added","additions":85,"deletions":0,"changes":85,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F1ff04e23a08d482b4b22f854e2b24dc21512151726ba0e798b32efc094746cf0","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F1ff04e23a08d482b4b22f854e2b24dc21512151726ba0e798b32efc094746cf0","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F1ff04e23a08d482b4b22f854e2b24dc21512151726ba0e798b32efc094746cf0?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,85 @@\n+**定理 2.2（持久 Bernoulli 反例）。** 令 $r=m-1$，取\n+\n+$$\n+0<p<1,\n+\\qquad 0<\\delta<\\frac{\\min\\{p,1-p\\}}{r},\n+\\qquad p_i=p+i\\delta\\quad(0\\le i\\le r).\n+$$\n+\n+有 $m$ 个持久发射类 $E_i$。完整配置为 $(E_i,h)$ 或 $(R_\\pm,h)$，其中 $h$\n+是完整有序的已取得档案。长度一的探针在每个 $(E_i,h)$ 上都合法，权限保持\n+可继续调用，其完整增量记录由探针名和输出位 $w$ 组成，转移为\n+\n+$$\n+(E_i,h)\\xrightarrow[\\ p_i^w(1-p_i)^{1-w}\\ ]{\\mathsf P,w}\n+(E_i,h\\mathbin{\\|}(\\mathsf P,w)),\\qquad w\\in\\{0,1\\}.\n+$$\n+\n+这里 $\\|$ 是向有序档案尾部追加，$q(E_i,h)=i+1$；固定的动作名可从 $W_j$\n+的字母中省写。两个根 $R_+$、$R_-$ 的首动作都写入同一个标记 $b_\\ast$，将\n+$(a,b_\\ast)$ 追加到原档案尾部，随后分别按\n+\n+$$\n+\\alpha_i=\\begin{cases}2^{1-r}\\binom ri&i\\text{ 偶},\\\\0&i\\text{ 奇},\\end{cases}\n+\\qquad\n+\\beta_i=\\begin{cases}0&i\\text{ 偶},\\\\2^{1-r}\\binom ri&i\\text{ 奇}\n+\\end{cases}\n+\\tag{UJB.7408}\n+$$\n+\n+选择后继 $(E_i,h\\mathbin{\\|}(a,b_\\ast))$；选择出的隐藏下标 $i$ 不写入首记录。\n+则 $d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\alpha,\\beta)=1$，而根的首标记加上 $k$ 个\n+探针输出的 law 在 $k<r$ 时完全相同，在 $k=r$ 时满足\n+\n+$$\n+d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\mathsf{Law}_{R_+}(b_\\ast,W_1,\\ldots,W_r),\n+                 \\mathsf{Law}_{R_-}(b_\\ast,W_1,\\ldots,W_r))\n+ =r!\\,\\delta^r.\n+\\tag{UJB.7409}\n+$$\n+\n+**证明。** 在每个实际调用前配置 $(E_i,h)$ 上，下一位的来源核恰为\n+$p_i^w(1-p_i)^{1-w}$，与已经保留的 $h$ 无关；后继保留同一个 $i$ 和完整档案。\n+因此即使 $h$ 含有全部早先输出，仍有\n+$\\Pr(W_j=w\\mid\\mathcal F_{j-1})=p_i^w(1-p_i)^{1-w}$，这逐历史实现了\n+(UJB.7401)。由塔式推导的 (UJB.7402)，给定首动作后的 $E_i,H_0$，词 law\n+是 Bernoulli 乘积。因为 $0<p_i<1$，每个有限位前缀都有正概率，故这也直接\n+覆盖每个可达的保留历史。所有有限次探针都可在同一来源上接续，没有重置或\n+删档；首动作 law 的终端质量为零，$L=1$ 且 $\\Delta=\\delta$。\n+\n+偶数项和奇数项的二项式系数都为 $2^{r-1}$，所以 (UJB.7408) 是两\n+个互不相交的概率分布。对一个长度为 $k$、含有 $s$ 个 $1$ 的词 $x$，其在\n+$E_i$ 下的概率是\n+\n+$$\n+Q_x(i)=(p+i\\delta)^s(1-p-i\\delta)^{k-s},\n+$$\n+\n+这是 $i$ 的次数不超过 $k$ 的多项式。有限差分恒等式\n+\n+$$\n+\\sum_{i=0}^r(-1)^i\\binom ri i^j=0\\quad(0\\le j<r),\n+\\qquad\n+\\sum_{i=0}^r(-1)^i\\binom ri i^r=(-1)^r r!\n+\\tag{UJB.7410}\n+$$\n+\n+说明当 $k<r$ 时两个混合 law 的每个词概率相同。令 $k=r$。$Q_x$ 的最高次\n+系数是 $\\delta^r(-1)^{r-s}$，故由 (UJB.7408) 和 (UJB.7410)，每一个词的\n+两根概率差的绝对值都是\n+\n+$$\n+2^{1-r}r!\\delta^r.\n+$$\n+\n+共有 $2^r$ 个词，半个 $\\ell^1$ 和正好给出 (UJB.7409)。因此最先可能的\n+探针数是 $r=m-1$，而差异的首项确实是 $\\delta^r$。令 $\\delta\\downarrow0$，\n+任何只依赖较低次 $\\delta$ 的统一逆界都会被这个族否定；(UJB.7405) 的指数\n+不能普遍降低。证毕。\n+\n+任意在固定上限 $k$ 内依据已见词自适应停止、并把停止标记写入档案的策略，\n+都是完整长度 $k$ 词 law 的一个共同 Markov 推送（可用填充符把短词补到长度\n+$k$）。数据处理不等式说明这种停止 law 的总变差不超过完整词 law 的总变差。\n+故在 $k<r$ 时它仍完全相同，在 $k=r$ 时也不超过 (UJB.7409)；停止规则不能\n+绕过交替二项式的消去。\n+"},{"sha":"81d90838cf9c1d17d57fd6ba49b52df140bc7547","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/3612fa618127c529b161d7008bc9d98afe24b32c944575e366923baf36262906","status":"added","additions":2,"deletions":0,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F3612fa618127c529b161d7008bc9d98afe24b32c944575e366923baf36262906","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F3612fa618127c529b161d7008bc9d98afe24b32c944575e366923baf36262906","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F3612fa618127c529b161d7008bc9d98afe24b32c944575e366923baf36262906?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@\n+**注 486.5（两侧所需输入的差别）。** 下侧用到的只是边界极限的符号与零点的无穷性。上侧仅凭正定性与零点的无穷性不够。假如零点纵坐标恰为 $\\{\\pm nc:n\\ge1\\}$ 且都是单零点，则 $L=(K-\\tfrac12)\\mathbf 1_{\\{0\\}}+\\tfrac12\\mathbf 1_{c\\mathbb Z}$ 在 $K\\ge1/2$ 时是 $c\\mathbb Z$ 上的正定函数，与有界上界相容。因此仅凭正定性与零点的无穷性推不出上侧；本节的证明用零点计数的超线性增长 (486.1) 补足。\n+"},{"sha":"174a8bb912959c294bfc8117c692b17d1357583d","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/3bdabc0cb4806ead560441b48db04a28ff07de9f4de4c74125b3191dd10d9da6","status":"added","additions":93,"deletions":0,"changes":93,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F3bdabc0cb4806ead560441b48db04a28ff07de9f4de4c74125b3191dd10d9da6","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F3bdabc0cb4806ead560441b48db04a28ff07de9f4de4c74125b3191dd10d9da6","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F3bdabc0cb4806ead560441b48db04a28ff07de9f4de4c74125b3191dd10d9da6?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,93 @@\n+### 2.1 来源、商类与可执行探针\n+\n+固定有限的事件—记录字母表 $B$、终止字母表 $T$、探针字母表 $\\mathcal A$，以及\n+一个有限的已实现后继商\n+\n+$$\n+C=\\{1,\\ldots,m\\},\\qquad m\\ge 2.\n+$$\n+\n+一次首动作的完整行由一个概率分布 $\\rho$ 给出。它的质量分别写成\n+$\\rho(b,c)$ 和 $\\rho(b,t)$，其中 $(b,c)\\in B\\times C$ 是带有首事件和整条首记录的\n+成功后继，$(b,t)\\in B\\times T$ 是带有同一首记录的终止后继。$b$ 必须包含合法性、\n+拒绝原因和权限结果等会影响后续选择或解释的字段；若这些字段不能被写入 $b$，\n+下文只在所有候选来源共有的合法域上成立。终端 $t$ 不与任何 $c$ 合并。\n+\n+固定首动作前已经取得的档案；以下各行 $\\rho$ 都在这个共同初始条件下比较。\n+令 $S_{\\mathrm{actual}}$ 为所有成功后可达的实际状态（包括带完整档案的实际配置），\n+并令 $q:S_{\\mathrm{actual}}\\to C$ 为把实际状态或配置映射到其已实现后继商类的商映射。\n+首动作成功后的实际状态记为 $S_0$，令 $C_0=q(S_0)$。$H_0$ 是此时的完整\n+已取得上下文，包含旧档案和首记录 $b$。连续调用同一个长度为 $L$ 的宏探针\n+$\\mathsf P$；$W_j\\in\\mathcal A^L$ 是第 $j$ 次调用实际写入的完整有序事件—记录词，\n+$S_j$ 和 $H_j$ 分别是调用后的实际状态与完整已取得上下文。特别地，$H_j$\n+保留 $H_0,W_1,\\ldots,W_j$，不覆盖、删除或重排已有记录。\n+\n+令 $\\mathcal F_j$ 为到第 $j$ 次调用结束为止的实际过去所生成的滤过，包含\n+$S_0,\\ldots,S_j$、$H_0,\\ldots,H_j$ 以及这些调用的全部记录、控制状态和权限。\n+$\\mathcal F_0$ 是第一次探针之前的实际过去，$\\mathcal F_{j-1}$ 是第 $j$ 次\n+探针的调用前信息。这里包含实际状态只是为了陈述来源核的条件，不赋予观察者\n+读取隐藏类或完整 law 的操作。每个允许的实际代表元和每个允许的调用前历史\n+上的来源转移核都须满足同一个点态校准律，其条件期望写法是\n+\n+$$\n+\\Pr(W_j=w\\mid\\mathcal F_{j-1})=P_{C_0}(w),\n+\\qquad w\\in\\mathcal A^L,\\quad 1\\le j\\le r.\n+\\tag{UJB.7401}\n+$$\n+\n+其中 $P_c$ 与代表元和实际过去无关；零概率历史处采用所声明的点态转移核，\n+不对零概率事件作条件除法。每次宏探针在所有支持分支上合法，每一个支持结果\n+都满足 $q(S_j)=C_0$，且权限允许下一次所需调用；完整的实际状态和完整记录\n+仍被保留。这一来源条件约束的是给定实际过去的下一输出，而不只是各次调用\n+未经历史条件化的边缘律。\n+\n+由此，对每个有正概率的初始条件 $(C_0,H_0)=(c,h_0)$，\n+\n+$$\n+\\Pr(W_1=w_1,\\ldots,W_r=w_r\\mid C_0=c,H_0=h_0)\n+ =\\prod_{j=1}^rP_c(w_j).\n+\\tag{UJB.7402}\n+$$\n+\n+确实，令 $D_{k-1}=\\{W_1=w_1,\\ldots,W_{k-1}=w_{k-1}\\}$，其中 $D_0$ 是全空间。\n+它属于 $\\mathcal F_{k-1}$，而 $C_0,H_0$ 属于 $\\mathcal F_0$。条件期望的塔式律给出\n+\n+$$\n+\\begin{aligned}\n+&\\Pr(D_{k-1},W_k=w_k\\mid C_0,H_0)\\\\\n+&\\quad=\\mathbb E\\!\\left[\n+ \\mathbf1_{D_{k-1}}\\Pr(W_k=w_k\\mid\\mathcal F_{k-1})\n+ \\mid C_0,H_0\\right]\\\\\n+&\\quad=P_{C_0}(w_k)\\Pr(D_{k-1}\\mid C_0,H_0).\n+\\end{aligned}\n+$$\n+\n+对 $k$ 归纳即得 (UJB.7402)。即使 $H_{k-1}$ 已经保留早先输出，该推导仍然\n+成立；整向量的乘积律只在初始条件下陈述，不以生成了这些输出的后续历史\n+再次条件化。它不允许克隆来源、重置到一个隐藏类端口、免费取得校准样本，\n+或把被探针消耗的权限重新当作仍然存在。\n+\n+写\n+\n+$$\n+\\Delta=\\min_{c\\ne d}d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(P_c,P_d)>0,\n+\\qquad\n+d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\mu,\\nu)=\\frac12\\sum_x|\\mu(x)-\\nu(x)|.\n+\\tag{UJB.7403}\n+$$\n+\n+这里的总变差是有限字母表上的通常归一化距离。给定 $r=m-1$ 次宏探针，\n+(UJB.7402) 对 $H_0$ 的一致性允许在每个首记录和成功类上求和；终止分支不再\n+调用探针。因此首动作与后续档案的联合 law 为\n+\n+$$\n+\\begin{aligned}\n+\\mathcal M_\\rho(b,\\mathsf{term},t)&=\\rho(b,t),\\\\\n+\\mathcal M_\\rho(b,\\mathsf{succ},w_1,\\ldots,w_r)\n+ &=\\sum_{c\\in C}\\rho(b,c)\\prod_{j=1}^rP_c(w_j).\n+\\end{aligned}\n+\\tag{UJB.7404}\n+$$\n+\n+它保留 $b$ 与 $c$ 的联合关系、每个终端的身份和每一个实际写入的探针词。\n+"},{"sha":"f8b80b9d2a67d898df2a9bb130ef56c17a1d6517","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/3e35b0cc8b430d586346851cc782ce3ee0c6fb9a813535621aba875021578f9c","status":"added","additions":14,"deletions":0,"changes":14,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F3e35b0cc8b430d586346851cc782ce3ee0c6fb9a813535621aba875021578f9c","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F3e35b0cc8b430d586346851cc782ce3ee0c6fb9a813535621aba875021578f9c","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F3e35b0cc8b430d586346851cc782ce3ee0c6fb9a813535621aba875021578f9c?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@\n+**注 486.5（两侧所需输入的差别）。** 下侧用到的只是边界极限的符号与零点的无穷性。上侧仅凭正定性与零点的无穷性不够。假如零点纵坐标恰为 $\\{\\pm nc:n\\ge1\\}$ 且都是单零点，则 $L=(K-\\tfrac12)\\mathbf 1_{\\{0\\}}+\\tfrac12\\mathbf 1_{c\\mathbb Z}$ 在 $K\\ge1/2$ 时是 $c\\mathbb Z$ 上的正定函数，与有界上界相容。因此仅凭正定性与零点的无穷性推不出上侧；本节的证明用零点计数的超线性增长 (486.1) 补足。\n+\n+**范围与文献归属。** 以下各项是经典输入：\n+- (485.1)、(486.1) 与 Landau–Widder 定理；\n+- $\\zeta(1/2)\\ne0$；\n+- 正核配合 Landau 正性来约束边界留数，属于 Ingham 振荡方法。\n+\n+本节的 `repo-derived` 内容如下：\n+- 命题 486.1–486.2 的两个预算不等式，其中 (a) 步把有限和的 Gram 正性带到边界极限。\n+- 把上侧化归为短区间零点重数的有界性：用 $0$ 附近的无零点间隙消去交叉项。\n+- 定理 486.3–486.4 对全实中心函数 $\\mathcal T$ 的双侧无界性。\n+\n+本节结论只关于全实中心函数，不推出 §481 所述被选整数来源上的下界，也不推出 RH 或每个 $n>5040$ 的严格 Robin 不等式。\n+"},{"sha":"0e135291575752541bb8a647527369499ecabbce","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/46d5854b76444edfb28516cac8745fd4a816c33886e685859abeb75c580e9ef5","status":"added","additions":5,"deletions":0,"changes":5,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F46d5854b76444edfb28516cac8745fd4a816c33886e685859abeb75c580e9ef5","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F46d5854b76444edfb28516cac8745fd4a816c33886e685859abeb75c580e9ef5","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F46d5854b76444edfb28516cac8745fd4a816c33886e685859abeb75c580e9ef5?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@\n+本节的 `repo-derived` 内容如下：\n+- 命题 486.1–486.2 的两个预算不等式，其中 (a) 步把有限和的 Gram 正性带到边界极限。\n+- 把上侧化归为短区间零点重数的有界性：用 $0$ 附近的无零点间隙消去交叉项。\n+- 定理 486.3–486.4 对全实中心函数 $\\mathcal T$ 的双侧无界性。\n+"},{"sha":"e21caedb0fffc2f14dc2eb117f2b9b520850ed8d","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/4fbeeb66f0dab938d0b575387d92d33f8c1b6c01585f3cff217642ba9b5b12b4","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F4fbeeb66f0dab938d0b575387d92d33f8c1b6c01585f3cff217642ba9b5b12b4","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F4fbeeb66f0dab938d0b575387d92d33f8c1b6c01585f3cff217642ba9b5b12b4","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F4fbeeb66f0dab938d0b575387d92d33f8c1b6c01585f3cff217642ba9b5b12b4?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+### 2.1 来源、商类与可执行探针"},{"sha":"a02c6a7899f8f284ce6a71948110ee402cbbee0d","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/569388e673d1537b0c75191230e5d4e912a668f562161cae59376524524f02d2","status":"added","additions":21,"deletions":0,"changes":21,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F569388e673d1537b0c75191230e5d4e912a668f562161cae59376524524f02d2","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F569388e673d1537b0c75191230e5d4e912a668f562161cae59376524524f02d2","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F569388e673d1537b0c75191230e5d4e912a668f562161cae59376524524f02d2?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@\n+### 2.5 接回四视图及不可恢复边界\n+\n+引理 2.1 只恢复一个实际首行及其终端部分。把恢复的行重新放回\n+(UJB.7301) 的 typed joint law 后，只有当合法性、selector、记录更新和后继都\n+沿同一商纤维下降，才可继续使用 (UJB.7310)--(UJB.7313) 的四视图运输。于是\n+空间、时间、边界、记忆仍必须是同一实际共同来源上的四个因子；恢复首行并不\n+推出 $K_n=A_n^{\\mathrm{law}}$ 的全层恒等，也不推出物理时空的本体恢复。\n+\n+有三类边界必须保留。第一，若探针会破坏 $c$、使所需后续调用不再合法，或只有\n+单次边缘校准而不满足给定实际过去的 (UJB.7401)，则没有本章的来源保证，不能\n+据此推出 (UJB.7402) 或把相同边缘律乘成张量 law。第二，若\n+合法性或拒绝原因藏在不可见字段，(UJB.7405) 只能在声明的共同合法范围内使用，\n+不能把非法分支静默合并。第三，即使行 law 已由引理唯一确定，重叠支持的一个\n+有限实际记录仍不能零误差识别隐藏的 $c$；那是 law 级统计逆，不是一次运行的\n+历史恢复。只有额外的互不相交支持或等价的可测分割，才会回到 UJB.7307--7309\n+所讨论的零误差边界。\n+\n+这也说明本桥没有新增 checkpoint 原语：当前增量只用了已经允许的首动作、实际\n+返回的 class-preserving 宏和完整档案。改变探针成为破坏性的操作、隐藏合法性，\n+或把未取得的完整 law 当作输入，都会越过本章的假设。\n+"},{"sha":"a83c6d54336a0559f74785cf5bc6d9ea49e2a2ef","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/6287dabaf266f9b10cd6c137a5b636fc5ff73cc180d195d9dc2a2560825ffa99","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F6287dabaf266f9b10cd6c137a5b636fc5ff73cc180d195d9dc2a2560825ffa99","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F6287dabaf266f9b10cd6c137a5b636fc5ff73cc180d195d9dc2a2560825ffa99","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F6287dabaf266f9b10cd6c137a5b636fc5ff73cc180d195d9dc2a2560825ffa99?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+### 2.3 交替二项族：阶数和指数都是尖锐的"},{"sha":"aa1d3cff9d9a160989888296a8ce5cc801525cf2","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/7d874ad5dbaaaa1f43ce8ed552aca17ddd801b6f51cc4f441cfca5bd55732244","status":"added","additions":12,"deletions":0,"changes":12,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F7d874ad5dbaaaa1f43ce8ed552aca17ddd801b6f51cc4f441cfca5bd55732244","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F7d874ad5dbaaaa1f43ce8ed552aca17ddd801b6f51cc4f441cfca5bd55732244","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F7d874ad5dbaaaa1f43ce8ed552aca17ddd801b6f51cc4f441cfca5bd55732244?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@\n+**命题 486.2（间隙内的二次预算）。** 设 $\\delta>0$，$t_1,\\dots,t_n$ 两两不同且落在一个长度小于 $\\delta$ 的区间内。设 $L$ 在点组 $\\{0,t_1,\\dots,t_n\\}$ 的全部两两差处存在，并且其中满足 $0<|t|<\\delta$ 的点处 $L(t)=0$。则\n+$$\n+\\sum_{j=1}^n|L(t_j)|^2\\le L(0)^2.\n+\\tag{486.4}\n+$$\n+\n+证明。对 $j\\ne k$ 有 $0<|t_j-t_k|<\\delta$，故 $L(t_j-t_k)=0$。在点组 $0,t_1,\\dots,t_n$ 上对命题 486.1 证明的 (a) 步取 $a_0=L(0)$，$a_j=-\\overline{L(t_j)}$。由共轭关系，(486.3) 化为\n+$$\n+L(0)^3-2L(0)\\sum_j|L(t_j)|^2+L(0)\\sum_j|L(t_j)|^2\\ge0 .\n+$$\n+若 $L(0)>0$ 即得 (486.4)；若 $L(0)=0$，改取 $a_0=s>0$ 与 $a_j=-\\overline{L(t_j)}$，得 $-2s\\sum_j|L(t_j)|^2\\ge0$，(486.4) 仍成立。证毕。\n+"},{"sha":"bb3365cba9f484d9f651e804ca02f65d2e2ddbfa","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/95e407e4096324d6cae7c17d49f091d125c601634f107881410add9c89257149","status":"added","additions":12,"deletions":0,"changes":12,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F95e407e4096324d6cae7c17d49f091d125c601634f107881410add9c89257149","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F95e407e4096324d6cae7c17d49f091d125c601634f107881410add9c89257149","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F95e407e4096324d6cae7c17d49f091d125c601634f107881410add9c89257149?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@\n+**范围与文献归属。** 以下各项是经典输入：\n+- (485.1)、(486.1) 与 Landau–Widder 定理；\n+- $\\zeta(1/2)\\ne0$；\n+- 正核配合 Landau 正性来约束边界留数，属于 Ingham 振荡方法。\n+\n+本节的 `repo-derived` 内容如下：\n+- 命题 486.1–486.2 的两个预算不等式，其中 (a) 步把有限和的 Gram 正性带到边界极限。\n+- 把上侧化归为短区间零点重数的有界性：用 $0$ 附近的无零点间隙消去交叉项。\n+- 定理 486.3–486.4 对全实中心函数 $\\mathcal T$ 的双侧无界性。\n+\n+本节结论只关于全实中心函数，不推出 §481 所述被选整数来源上的下界，也不推出 RH 或每个 $n>5040$ 的严格 Robin 不等式。\n+"},{"sha":"558cd276828f5a70d4c1959576d7c524e9e0dff3","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/96e4d75e2a05b834d71ffc895740869548ecc870245e95ff81da864dc31a1162","status":"added","additions":68,"deletions":0,"changes":68,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F96e4d75e2a05b834d71ffc895740869548ecc870245e95ff81da864dc31a1162","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F96e4d75e2a05b834d71ffc895740869548ecc870245e95ff81da864dc31a1162","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2F96e4d75e2a05b834d71ffc895740869548ecc870245e95ff81da864dc31a1162?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,68 @@\n+**引理 2.1（有限类的有界探针逆）。** 在 (UJB.7401)--(UJB.7404) 的条件下，\n+$\\mathcal M_\\rho$ 唯一决定 $\\rho$，并且对任意两个允许的首行动作行\n+$\\rho,\\rho'$ 有\n+\n+$$\n+d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\rho,\\rho')\n+ \\le \\min\\left\\{1,\n+m\\Delta^{-(m-1)}d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(\\mathcal M_\\rho,\\mathcal M_{\\rho'})\\right\\}.\n+\\tag{UJB.7405}\n+$$\n+\n+**证明。** 对每一对 $c\\ne d$，从有限字母表的总变差定义选取\n+$f_{cd}:\\mathcal A^L\\to[0,1]$，使\n+\n+$$\n+\\mathbb E_{P_c}f_{cd}-\\mathbb E_{P_d}f_{cd}\n+ =d_{\\mathrm{TV}}(P_c,P_d)\\ge\\Delta.\n+$$\n+\n+令 $g_{cd}=f_{cd}-\\mathbb E_{P_d}f_{cd}$。于是 $|g_{cd}|\\le1$，\n+$\\mathbb E_{P_d}g_{cd}=0$，且 $\\mathbb E_{P_c}g_{cd}\\ge\\Delta$。把\n+$C\\setminus\\{c\\}$ 任意双射到 $\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}$，定义\n+\n+$$\n+h_c(w_1,\\ldots,w_r)=\\prod_{d\\ne c}g_{cd}(w_{\\iota_c(d)}).\n+$$\n+\n+由 (UJB.7402)，对 $k\\ne c$，$P_k^{\\otimes r}$ 下至少一个因子（$d=k$）均值为零，故\n+\n+$$\n+\\mathbb E_{P_k^{\\otimes r}}h_c=0\\quad(k\\ne c),\n+\\qquad\n+\\alpha_c:=\\mathbb E_{P_c^{\\otimes r}}h_c\\ge\\Delta^r.\n+\\tag{UJB.7406}\n+$$\n+\n+这给出一个显式的有界对偶读出，而不需要写出未界的矩阵逆。任意\n+$F:B\\times(C\\sqcup T)\\to[-1,1]$ 定义一个复合记录上的函数 $G_F$：在终端\n+$(b,\\mathsf{term},t)$ 上取 $F(b,t)$，在成功记录上取\n+\n+$$\n+G_F(b,\\mathsf{succ},w_1,\\ldots,w_r)\n+ =\\sum_{c\\in C}F(b,c)\\frac{h_c(w_1,\\ldots,w_r)}{\\alpha_c}.\n+$$\n+\n+因此 $|G_F|\\le m\\Delta^{-r}$，并由 (UJB.7406) 得\n+\n+$$\n+\\mathbb E_{\\mathcal M_\\rho}G_F=\\mathbb E_\\rho F.\n+$$\n+\n+取 $F$ 遍历 $[-1,1]$ 中的函数，有限集上的对偶表述给出未归一化变差范数\n+的界\n+$\\|\\rho-\\rho'\\|_1\\le m\\Delta^{-r}\\|\\mathcal M_\\rho-\\mathcal M_{\\rho'}\\|_1$；\n+两边除以 $2$ 即得 (UJB.7405)，再用概率距离不超过 $1$ 截断。若两份复合 law\n+相等，所有 $F$ 的期望都相等，故首行（包括每个终端）相等。证毕。\n+\n+这个证明也说明为什么必须保留首事件和首记录：若只保留后继的边缘 law，\n+$F(b,c)$ 的联合测试就不再能被 $G_F$ 实现。宏的实际动作数至多为\n+\n+$$\n+1+rL=1+(m-1)L,\n+\\tag{UJB.7407}\n+$$\n+\n+首动作一次，随后每个类保持宏各执行一次。$m=1$ 时没有分离问题，首行动作 law\n+本身就是行，取 $r=0$ 可得到直接读出；(UJB.7403)--(UJB.7406) 专用于 $m\\ge2$。\n+"},{"sha":"b7176c98a9e92bb518df1b597affcff39fe32609","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/ba98ddf8ed9235c2c2a8089683e3460b5c70965fc912eeb7bdd095f5522ed537","status":"added","additions":16,"deletions":0,"changes":16,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fba98ddf8ed9235c2c2a8089683e3460b5c70965fc912eeb7bdd095f5522ed537","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fba98ddf8ed9235c2c2a8089683e3460b5c70965fc912eeb7bdd095f5522ed537","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fba98ddf8ed9235c2c2a8089683e3460b5c70965fc912eeb7bdd095f5522ed537?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@\n+### 2.6 相关文献与使用范围\n+\n+Vandermeulen--Scott 的 [Lemma 5.3](https://arxiv.org/html/1607.00071v2) 证明\n+两两不共线的 $m$ 个非零 Hilbert 向量的 $(m-1)$ 次张量幂线性无关；它给出本章\n+“有限类需要有限张量阶”的已知背景。本章的有界读出直接用 (UJB.7406) 的乘积\n+测试函数，因此没有把该文的未知混合分解定理冒充为本行逆。\n+\n+Berrut--Trefethen 的 [barycentric interpolation, §2](https://people.maths.ox.ac.uk/trefethen/barycentric.pdf)\n+给出已知互异节点的 Lagrange 插值读出；(UJB.7410) 的交替二项式计算是其在\n+等距 Bernoulli 节点上的显式有限差分版本，而不是新的一般插值定理。\n+\n+Bian--Abate 的 [Theorem 6 and Figure 1](https://arxiv.org/html/1701.04547v3)\n+展示概率 Markov 链中 branching/bisimulation 与有限 trace law 之间的结构—取得\n+差距及总变差界。本章的持久混合族把这个差距落实为同一 typed row 上的精确阶数\n+和精确常数；它不声称解决该文的一般近似模型问题。\n+"},{"sha":"ffe52c12ac2ed9116416b9189200544a6455d789","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/bceed2519fb1d002734f3a19af2196befaace9254c01f471b5240070100dd58a","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fbceed2519fb1d002734f3a19af2196befaace9254c01f471b5240070100dd58a","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fbceed2519fb1d002734f3a19af2196befaace9254c01f471b5240070100dd58a","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fbceed2519fb1d002734f3a19af2196befaace9254c01f471b5240070100dd58a?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+## 486. 原前向价格核的无条件双侧无界性"},{"sha":"f70cde42ff856ece0a5d84ba71ecfd6cdef3c124","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/c12b80f1c2faa4ca04eb79b9d5ccdc4358e05d33048992b7934bb73630d2a005","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fc12b80f1c2faa4ca04eb79b9d5ccdc4358e05d33048992b7934bb73630d2a005","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fc12b80f1c2faa4ca04eb79b9d5ccdc4358e05d33048992b7934bb73630d2a005","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fc12b80f1c2faa4ca04eb79b9d5ccdc4358e05d33048992b7934bb73630d2a005?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+### 2.6 相关文献与使用范围"},{"sha":"65b08749cf00c276fd278ab7d1b3938e9adcaaec","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/c980aaf8ee973a45563fc2958e114fbef6b51fe9ef2bbff9447f1dfa94f0a53d","status":"added","additions":16,"deletions":0,"changes":16,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fc980aaf8ee973a45563fc2958e114fbef6b51fe9ef2bbff9447f1dfa94f0a53d","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fc980aaf8ee973a45563fc2958e114fbef6b51fe9ef2bbff9447f1dfa94f0a53d","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fc980aaf8ee973a45563fc2958e114fbef6b51fe9ef2bbff9447f1dfa94f0a53d?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@\n+## 486. 原前向价格核的无条件双侧无界性\n+\n+沿用 §481 与 §485 的记号。定理 485.2–485.3 在 RH 不成立时给出 $\\liminf\\mathcal T=-\\infty$ 与 $\\limsup\\mathcal T=+\\infty$，在 RH 下只给出 $\\liminf\\mathcal T\\le-1/2\\le1/2\\le\\limsup\\mathcal T$。本节在 RH 下也得到两侧无界，于是两侧无界无条件成立。工具是正测度的 Laplace 变换在虚轴上的边界极限满足的有限 Gram 正性。下侧只用到零点有无穷多个；上侧还要用到零点计数的增长与 $0$ 附近的无零点间隙。\n+\n+经典输入除 §485 所列各项外，还有 Riemann–von Mangoldt 公式\n+$$\n+N(T,2T)=\\frac T{2\\pi}\\Bigl(\\log\\frac T{2\\pi}+2\\log2-1\\Bigr)+O(\\log T),\n+\\tag{486.1}\n+$$\n+其中 $N(T_1,T_2)$ 是纵坐标落在 $(T_1,T_2]$ 中的非平凡零点个数（计重数）。下文只用它推出的 $N(T,2T)/T\\to\\infty$。\n+\n+下面两个命题共用以下前提：$\\mu$ 是 $\\mathbb R$ 上的正 Borel 测度，对每个 $\\sigma>0$ 有 $\\int e^{-\\sigma y}\\,d\\mu(y)<\\infty$；记 $G(s)=\\int e^{-sy}\\,d\\mu(y)$（$\\Re s>0$），并在极限存在处记\n+$$\n+L(t)=\\lim_{\\sigma\\downarrow0}\\sigma\\,G(\\sigma+it).\n+$$\n+"},{"sha":"941dc22191ee0f5dcde97549b9bab5894a550f88","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/cf1f30a913ba94b676df75e2cae53e94b14427a1e57f865dc5cfe1f4642caad4","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fcf1f30a913ba94b676df75e2cae53e94b14427a1e57f865dc5cfe1f4642caad4","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fcf1f30a913ba94b676df75e2cae53e94b14427a1e57f865dc5cfe1f4642caad4","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fcf1f30a913ba94b676df75e2cae53e94b14427a1e57f865dc5cfe1f4642caad4?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+## 2. 有限实际探针的联合行逆"},{"sha":"898555624cbb9e5e4d8bf602eab00cc9f198a63f","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/d7c83b44706b98a430e716e84e6567f046c8ffba86f87e4c46695f0b92b2636d","status":"added","additions":47,"deletions":0,"changes":47,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fd7c83b44706b98a430e716e84e6567f046c8ffba86f87e4c46695f0b92b2636d","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fd7c83b44706b98a430e716e84e6567f046c8ffba86f87e4c46695f0b92b2636d","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fd7c83b44706b98a430e716e84e6567f046c8ffba86f87e4c46695f0b92b2636d?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,47 @@\n+### 2.4 结构细化与取得 law 的错位\n+\n+令 $S_{\\mathrm{core}}=\\{R_+,R_-,E_0,\\ldots,E_r\\}$ 是同一族的有限根—发射核，\n+$\\pi$ 是从完整配置 $(x,h)$ 到 $x$ 的投影。在这个有限核上取 UJB.7303 的\n+结构核链 $K_n^{\\mathrm{core}}$，并把一个发射类的一步 Bernoulli law 作为\n+探针动作的联合记录。当前读出只区分“根”和“发射类”角色，所以所有 $E_i$ 先在\n+同一类中，且 $R_+$、$R_-$ 也同类。由于 $p_i$ 两两不同，$E_i$ 的一步联合 law\n+在 $K_1^{\\mathrm{core}}$ 已互相分开；根的首动作在 $K_0^{\\mathrm{core}}$ 商上仍\n+只看到同一个发射类，故两个根在 $K_1^{\\mathrm{core}}$ 仍相等。到了\n+$K_2^{\\mathrm{core}}$，首动作的后继分布落在 $K_1^{\\mathrm{core}}$ 的单点发射类上，\n+偶数支撑和奇数支撑互不相交，两个根分开。因此\n+\n+$$\n+K_2^{\\mathrm{core}}=\\operatorname{diag}(S_{\\mathrm{core}}).\n+$$\n+\n+完整配置上的对应链 $\\widetilde K_n$ 采用同一角色读出和每步实际新增的记录；\n+完整旧档案继续保留，并供后续策略使用。合法性、下一增量记录及后继核投影都\n+只依赖 $\\pi$，而追加档案不改变核心后继。由 (UJB.7303) 归纳，\n+\n+$$\n+\\widetilde K_n=(\\pi\\times\\pi)^{-1}(K_n^{\\mathrm{core}}),\n+\\qquad\n+\\widetilde K_2=\\ker\\pi=\\widetilde K_3=\\cdots.\n+$$\n+\n+所以第二层的对角断言只在有限核上成立；$(E_i,h)$ 与 $(E_i,h')$ 在 $h\\ne h'$\n+时仍是不同的完整配置。若把整份旧档案额外纳入当前读出，则零步关系已经改变，\n+不属于这里的角色读出链。\n+\n+从两根上相同的初始档案出发，取得 law 链看到的完整新增记录是 $b_\\ast$ 和\n+持久发射输出；在前面加上共同的旧档案不改变 law 相等性或总变差。总动作数为\n+$n=1+k$ 时，\n+(UJB.7410) 给出\n+\n+$$\n+R_+\\,A_n^{\\mathrm{law}}\\,R_-\n+\\quad(1\\le n\\le m-1),\n+\\qquad\n+R_+\\not\\!A_m^{\\mathrm{law}}R_-.\n+\\tag{UJB.7411}\n+$$\n+\n+所以有限核及其上述提升链的结构稳定指数为 $2$ 并不限制取得 law 的平台长度；在这组实际来源中，\n+平台可一直持续到总根加探针 horizon $m$。这不是对既有 $K_n\\subseteq A_n^{\\mathrm{law}}$\n+的改写，而是一个达到该包含方向极限的有限见证。\n+"},{"sha":"2ae2c6b95538f453ba0194da3275c2c9d02f4614","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/db6b50b01846bbd1ee3c01e9c5a2ef564a8560bf0820497e81d4df50951569c4","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fdb6b50b01846bbd1ee3c01e9c5a2ef564a8560bf0820497e81d4df50951569c4","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fdb6b50b01846bbd1ee3c01e9c5a2ef564a8560bf0820497e81d4df50951569c4","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fdb6b50b01846bbd1ee3c01e9c5a2ef564a8560bf0820497e81d4df50951569c4?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+### 2.2 有界逆与精确行恢复"},{"sha":"784233c7446c704d895b134b3a1991ac851d2006","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/dd01be142785c4699fee995b38adffc1392d5c39c2139c4ecc750618c2d7bc20","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fdd01be142785c4699fee995b38adffc1392d5c39c2139c4ecc750618c2d7bc20","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fdd01be142785c4699fee995b38adffc1392d5c39c2139c4ecc750618c2d7bc20","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fdd01be142785c4699fee995b38adffc1392d5c39c2139c4ecc750618c2d7bc20?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+### 2.4 结构细化与取得 law 的错位"},{"sha":"12e9931d6798b00825b7dfedfcb8708e6b378736","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/e412087394c7658001c9d98bfa3da0999737e7879737a4f9b164424c1f4a1759","status":"added","additions":5,"deletions":0,"changes":5,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fe412087394c7658001c9d98bfa3da0999737e7879737a4f9b164424c1f4a1759","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fe412087394c7658001c9d98bfa3da0999737e7879737a4f9b164424c1f4a1759","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fe412087394c7658001c9d98bfa3da0999737e7879737a4f9b164424c1f4a1759?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@\n+**定理 486.3（RH 下的双侧无界性）。** 设 RH 与 (485.1) 成立。\n+\n+1. 若 $\\mathcal T(x)\\ge-\\kappa$ 对充分大的 $x$ 成立，则对非平凡零点的每个有限集 $Z$ 有 $|Z|\\le16\\kappa^2$。因此 $\\liminf_{x\\to\\infty}\\mathcal T(x)=-\\infty$。\n+2. 再设 (486.1)。若 $\\mathcal T(x)\\le K$ 对充分大的 $x$ 成立，则存在 $\\delta>0$，使每个长度小于 $\\delta$ 的区间内零点重数之和不超过 $4K^2$。这与 (486.1) 矛盾，因此 $\\limsup_{x\\to\\infty}\\mathcal T(x)=+\\infty$。\n+"},{"sha":"0af7ddf08d2b708b1b5eeb2a64c9e74513570370","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/efd62d3956e50e60fbef5bfa59f2e7f1dc75a60e17d2b8f3c97c9f209bef4498","status":"added","additions":9,"deletions":0,"changes":9,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fefd62d3956e50e60fbef5bfa59f2e7f1dc75a60e17d2b8f3c97c9f209bef4498","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fefd62d3956e50e60fbef5bfa59f2e7f1dc75a60e17d2b8f3c97c9f209bef4498","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Fefd62d3956e50e60fbef5bfa59f2e7f1dc75a60e17d2b8f3c97c9f209bef4498?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@\n+**定理 486.3（RH 下的双侧无界性）。** 设 RH 与 (485.1) 成立。\n+\n+1. 若 $\\mathcal T(x)\\ge-\\kappa$ 对充分大的 $x$ 成立，则对非平凡零点的每个有限集 $Z$ 有 $|Z|\\le16\\kappa^2$。因此 $\\liminf_{x\\to\\infty}\\mathcal T(x)=-\\infty$。\n+2. 再设 (486.1)。若 $\\mathcal T(x)\\le K$ 对充分大的 $x$ 成立，则存在 $\\delta>0$，使每个长度小于 $\\delta$ 的区间内零点重数之和不超过 $4K^2$。这与 (486.1) 矛盾，因此 $\\limsup_{x\\to\\infty}\\mathcal T(x)=+\\infty$。\n+\n+证明。(1) 取 $\\mu$ 为 $(\\mathcal T(x)+\\kappa)\\,dx/x$ 在 $(x_0,\\infty)$ 上的测度经 $\\log$ 的前推，它是正测度，且 $G(s)=\\mathcal F(s)+\\kappa x_0^{-s}/s$。如定理 485.2 证明的 RH 分支，取 $\\alpha=1/2+\\varepsilon$（$0<\\varepsilon<1/5$）。命题 485.1 的余项在包含闭虚轴的半平面 $\\Re s>\\alpha-7/10$ 上全纯；由 Landau–Widder 定理，对每个 $\\sigma>0$ 积分收敛，且 $G$ 在 $\\Re s>0$ 上与延拓一致。逐点计算 $L$：$L(0)=\\kappa$，因为 $\\mathcal F$ 在 $0$ 正则；若 $1/2+it$ 是重数 $m$ 的零点，则 $L(t)=-m/2$；其余 $t\\ne0$ 处 $\\zeta(1/2+it)\\ne0$，延拓在 $it$ 邻近全纯，故 $L(t)=0$。RH 下 $Z$ 中零点的纵坐标两两不同且非零（$\\zeta(1/2)\\ne0$）。以 $c=1/2$ 应用命题 486.1，得 $|Z|\\le16\\kappa^2$。非平凡零点有无穷多个，故不存在这样的 $\\kappa$。\n+\n+(2) 对 $K-\\mathcal T$ 作同样构造，$G(s)=Kx_0^{-s}/s-\\mathcal F(s)$。此时 $L(0)=K$，重数 $m$ 的零点处 $L(t)=+m/2$，其余 $t\\ne0$ 处 $L(t)=0$。由 $\\zeta(1/2)\\ne0$ 与连续性，存在 $\\delta>0$ 使 $\\zeta(1/2+it)\\ne0$ 对 $0<|t|<\\delta$ 成立；于是 $L$ 在 $0<|t|<\\delta$ 上为零。对长度小于 $\\delta$ 的区间内的零点应用命题 486.2，得 $\\sum m^2/4\\le K^2$，从而 $\\sum m\\le\\sum m^2\\le4K^2$。用 $\\lceil 2T/\\delta\\rceil$ 个长度不超过 $\\delta/2$ 的区间覆盖 $(T,2T]$，得 $N(T,2T)\\le4K^2(2T/\\delta+1)$，与 (486.1) 给出的 $N(T,2T)/T\\to\\infty$ 矛盾。证毕。\n+"},{"sha":"f8dd396a54ef4229c7f31690f86f93769788646d","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/f7d7acb79675155526f01e0ee7a060e768c3814213997fd516582ff3252eb2a4","status":"added","additions":1,"deletions":0,"changes":1,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Ff7d7acb79675155526f01e0ee7a060e768c3814213997fd516582ff3252eb2a4","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Ff7d7acb79675155526f01e0ee7a060e768c3814213997fd516582ff3252eb2a4","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Ff7d7acb79675155526f01e0ee7a060e768c3814213997fd516582ff3252eb2a4?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1 @@\n+### 2.5 接回四视图及不可恢复边界"},{"sha":"42316f20b96f945a6dcfc005dcf3678278fe9ebe","filename":"Meta/Digestion/atoms/sha256/fce7f1b467364165bd9d7f3979fede156e005380f35008f7bd2ccfdca2650859","status":"added","additions":24,"deletions":0,"changes":24,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Ffce7f1b467364165bd9d7f3979fede156e005380f35008f7bd2ccfdca2650859","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Ffce7f1b467364165bd9d7f3979fede156e005380f35008f7bd2ccfdca2650859","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fatoms%2Fsha256%2Ffce7f1b467364165bd9d7f3979fede156e005380f35008f7bd2ccfdca2650859?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@\n+**命题 486.1（同号边界项的预算）。** 设 $c>0$，$t_1,\\dots,t_n$ 两两不同且非零。设 $L$ 在点组 $\\{0,t_1,\\dots,t_n\\}$ 的全部两两差处存在，在其中每个非零点有 $\\Re L\\le0$，并且对每个 $j$ 有 $\\Re L(t_j)\\le-c$。则\n+$$\n+n\\,c^2\\le4\\,L(0)^2.\n+\\tag{486.2}\n+$$\n+\n+证明。(a) 设 $s_0,\\dots,s_n$ 为实数，$L$ 在全部差 $s_j-s_k$ 处存在，$a_0,\\dots,a_n\\in\\mathbb C$。对 $\\sigma>0$，\n+$$\n+0\\le\\int\\Bigl|\\sum_ja_je^{-is_jy}\\Bigr|^2\\sigma e^{-\\sigma y}\\,d\\mu(y)\n+=\\sum_{j,k}a_j\\overline{a_k}\\,\\sigma G\\bigl(\\sigma+i(s_j-s_k)\\bigr).\n+$$\n+被积函数有界乘以可积函数，和是有限和。令 $\\sigma\\downarrow0$ 得\n+$$\n+\\sum_{j,k}a_j\\overline{a_k}\\,L(s_j-s_k)\\ \\text{为非负实数}.\n+\\tag{486.3}\n+$$\n+由 $\\mu$ 为实测度，$G(\\sigma-it)=\\overline{G(\\sigma+it)}$，故 $L(-t)=\\overline{L(t)}$；又 $\\sigma G(\\sigma)\\ge0$，故 $L(0)\\ge0$。\n+\n+(b) 在点组 $s_0=0$、$s_j=t_j$ 上取 $a_0=s\\ge0$，$a_1=\\dots=a_n=1$。(486.3) 的实部为\n+$$\n+s^2L(0)+s\\sum_j\\Re\\bigl(L(t_j)+L(-t_j)\\bigr)+nL(0)+\\sum_{j\\ne k}\\Re L(t_j-t_k)\\ge0 .\n+$$\n+各 $\\Re L(-t_j)$ 与 $\\Re L(t_j-t_k)$（$j\\ne k$）都不大于零，故 $s^2L(0)-snc+nL(0)\\ge0$ 对每个 $s\\ge0$ 成立。若 $L(0)=0$，则 $-snc\\ge0$ 对每个 $s>0$ 成立，故 $n=0$，(486.2) 成立；否则取 $s=nc/(2L(0))$ 得 (486.2)。证毕。\n+"},{"sha":"9090accdb3579a1358fc274cd2fde19bc5ee6eb8","filename":"Meta/Digestion/backfill/fibonacci-analytic-frontier-interfaces-ii/context/029f1810372a5b8785624da0f0ae8e21ef97d2d2cb9f07cda749b49d605ec386.json","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1,"changes":2,"blob_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/blob/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fbackfill%2Ffibonacci-analytic-frontier-interfaces-ii%2Fcontext%2F029f1810372a5b8785624da0f0ae8e21ef97d2d2cb9f07cda749b49d605ec386.json","raw_url":"https://github.com/the-omega-institute/trureturing/raw/23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fbackfill%2Ffibonacci-analytic-frontier-interfaces-ii%2Fcontext%2F029f1810372a5b8785624da0f0ae8e21ef97d2d2cb9f07cda749b49d605ec386.json","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/the-omega-institute/trureturing/contents/Meta%2FDigestion%2Fbackfill%2Ffibonacci-analytic-frontier-interfaces-ii%2Fcontext%2F029f1810372a5b8785624da0f0ae8e21ef97d2d2cb9f07cda749b49d605ec386.json?ref=23a4ae6f843d1635869b7656fb6bd681121447a8","patch":"@@ -1 +1 @@\n-[{\"SchemaVersion\":1,\"Sour